WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:05.592
Off-site: identify physical Ethernet ports by link state and pre-stage the portal static subnet without dropping SSH.

2
00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:10.555
Expand Ubuntu 24.04 default 100 GiB LVM root across the full NVMe SSD and initialize OSCAR 3.11.6 completely offline.

3
00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:15.855
On-site in the portal rack: apply the staged static Netplan profile and scan enp2s0 for RPMs and RTSP cameras.
